8. Handlers — Loading / Sending / Empty / Error / Confirmation
All handlers are aligned, uniform, Dark Gray + White Light, live-animated. Same centering, same placement in every view.

8.1 Loading Handler — Vertical Envelope Flow
When: First open of any view, Refresh, Retry after error, tab / subtab switch. Duration ~800–1200ms. Actions disabled while loading.

Structure: viewBox="0 0 120 120", all on center axis x=60.

Building (top, x=50–70, y=14–30) → dotted connector → Envelope (center, x=30–90, y=48–82) → dotted connector → Person (bottom, head cx=60, cy=96)
Envelope rectangle: x=30, y=48, w=60, h=34, rx=3, fill white, stroke dark gray
V flap — FIXED, never rotates: polyline 30,48 → 60,70 → 90,48, apex exactly at 60,70, symmetric, inside rectangle, 8px+ margin, no clipping, no overflow
Animations:
Envelope: scale 1 → 1.04, origin (60,65), no rotation / translation
V flap: opacity pulse 1 → 0.6, geometry fixed
Dotted connectors: dash-flow (stroke-dashoffset)
Building / Person: opacity pulse in sequence, no movement
3 dots bounce in sequence + progress bar fills left→right, loops
Text: Loading LeadMaster... + per-view subtext: Loading Inbox... / Sent... / Outbox... / Deleted... / Assistant... / Automation... / Templates... / Scheduled... / Settings... / Contacts... / Compose...
Skeleton: 5 shimmer gray rows below SVG, same in every view
Fix applied: V flap was rotating / clipping on rectangle. Fixed by locking geometry, removing rotation, using padding + overflow: visible.

Standalone file: Loading SVG code is a single self-contained HTML file (SVG + CSS). Reuse the .lm-loader block verbatim.

8.2 Sending Handler — Horizontal Flight (Different Structure)
When: Send / Send Now / Resend / Send All Now. Shown as overlay / toast in Compose, Outbox, Scheduled, Sent for ~1.5s, then success state.

Structure — Horizontal, NOT vertical: viewBox="0 0 220 90".

Left: Person in circle (28,45, r=16) → Center: Curved dashed flight path M 44,45 Q 110,8 176,45 → Right: Person + Building team in circle (192,45, r=16)
Center element: Paper Plane (NOT envelope), flying left→right along curve via animateMotion, rotating with path, trailing dots, landing pulse on recipient
No envelope, no vertical stack, no V flap — this is intentionally different from Loading
Steps: Queued (clock) → Sending (plane) → Delivered (check), lighting up in sequence, connected by animated line
Text: Sending... + cycling subtext: Encrypting... / Attaching... / Sending to recipient... / Delivered
Progress: Horizontal bar fills, loops
8.3 Empty Handler — Logical 3D Isometric Box
When: Any list is empty: Inbox subtab empty, Sent / Outbox / Deleted / Scheduled empty, Templates empty after delete, Contacts empty, Calendar no reminders, Notes empty, Search no results.

Logic: Empty = an inbox that is literally empty. Show a 3D isometric empty box (you can see inside — it is empty) + one envelope floating above it, waiting to drop in. That is the story: “nothing here yet, waiting for the first mail.”

Structure: viewBox="0 0 240 160", centered (120,85).

Box: Top face #FFFFFF, Left face #E5E5E5, Right face #D4D4D4, stroke #2B2B2B 1.8. Width 110, depth 40, height 45. Interior: empty white floor.
Envelope: Small 3D envelope above box, centered x=120, y=28, V flap symmetric + aligned, floats translateY 0 → -6, tilt -2deg fixed.
People: 2 tiny 3D-ish peoples beside box — left pointing at empty box, right shrugging. Same B&W people style, small, not distracting.
Shadow: Ellipse under box, breathes in sync with box.
Animations (logical):
Envelope float + shadow inside box scales opposite
Box breathe 1 → 1.015, origin center-bottom
Shadow scale + opacity breathe
Dotted “waiting” arc from envelope → box interior, dash-flow
People bob in sequence, pointing arm pulse
0 badge pulses
Text: Nothing here yet + per-view subtext: No emails in Inbox / No sent emails / No emails in Outbox / Trash is empty / No scheduled emails / No templates yet / No contacts yet / No reminders / No notes yet
Action button (per view): Compose / Create Template / Add Contact / Add Reminder / Add Note / Create Rule — opens correct single Compose / create flow
GIF version: Transparent 3D Empty GIF, same logic, all elements strictly inside frame, safe margins, nothing touches / crosses frame edges, locked-off camera, loop. Regenerated version fixes earlier version where elements drifted out.
8.4 Error Handler — Aligned / Uniform
When: Any view fails to load, or Simulate Error in header is clicked.

Structure — Identical in all 9 views:

Centered, uniform warning-triangle SVG (same stroke style)
Title: Something went wrong
Message: We couldn't load this view. Please try again.
Buttons: [Retry] (dark gray) + [Go to Inbox] (outline)
Retry re-runs Loading handler (~800ms), then shows content
Same alignment, same size, same placement in every view
8.5 Confirmation Handler — Action Confirmation
When: Any destructive / important action: Delete, Delete Forever, Empty Trash, Discard Draft, Cancel Scheduled, Delete Template / Rule / Contact / Note / Reminder.

Example: Do you really want to delete this item? YES or NO

Structure:

Overlay: rgba(0,0,0,.45) + blur(4px), fade-in
Modal: max-width 400px, white, border #E5E5E5, radius 20px, shadow 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.22), pop animation scale .85 → 1, translateY 14 → 0, cubic-bezier (0.2, 1.4, 0.4, 1)
Top progress bar: dark gray, scaleX 0 → 1 → 0, loops
Icon: Trash in circle, dashed echo ring expanding + fading, trash shakes (rotate -6 → 5 → -3 → 2 → 0) on a loop
Title: Do you really want to delete this item?
Subtext: This action cannot be undone. The item will be moved to Deleted.
Item preview card: person/building icon + Name + Email / Location
Buttons: [NO, Keep it] (white, dark gray border) + [YES, Delete] (dark gray, white text, hover fill sweep white → text turns dark gray)
Note: Press Esc for No • Enter for Yes
Keyboard: Esc = No, Enter = Yes, click overlay outside = No (Close ×)
On Yes: trash animates out (translateY + scale + fade), toast appears: ✓ Deleted — moved to Deleted, modal closes after 1.8s
On No: modal closes, no change
Reduced motion: all animations disabled via prefers-reduced-motion
Rule: Never delete without confirmation. Never use window.confirm(). Always use this handler.

9. Handling Errors — Rules for All Features
Every view must have 3 states: Loading → Content / Empty → Error. Never show a blank page.
Loading: Show §8.1 loader, disable actions, ~800ms simulated.
Empty: Show §8.3 3D Empty, with correct subtext + correct action button.
Error: Show §8.4 error, with Retry + Go to Inbox. Retry must re-run Loading.
Sending: Show §8.2 sending, then success toast. On send failure, show Error + Retry (in Outbox as Failed status + Resend).
Confirmation: Show §8.5 before any destructive action. No silent deletes.
Search with no results: Show Empty handler with No results for “<query>” + Clear Search button.
Simulate Error: Header button triggers Error state in current view — for testing only, not in production data.
Toast pattern: Success = dark gray pill, ✓ <action> — <result>, auto-dismiss 1.8s. Error toast = same pill, ✕ <action> failed — Try again.
