15. How to Run / Test
Open LeadMaster dashboard.
Click each sidebar item → should show Loading → Content.
Click Refresh → Loading again.
Click Simulate Error → Error → Retry → Loading → Content.
Delete an item → Confirmation → YES → Toast → Deleted / NO → stays.
Send an email → Sending handler → Delivered toast.
Empty a list (delete all / filter to none) → 3D Empty → correct action button.
Open Compose → check fonts, HTML Insert, Preview, Schedule Send.
Open Sender Profile → check Organization / Personal badge + people illustration.
Open Settings → Components Organizer → drag to reorder → Save → Reset Order.
End of README — LeadMaster, Dark Gray + White Light, aligned to existing dashboard.
